"""Theory + literature check of 13 top unpublished suggestions from the recommender.
For each: model rank/score, proton-transfer check (dpKa, Cruz-Cabeza label), IL-likeness (ion size/flexibility/charge spread vs ion medians),
safety (GRAS-SCOGS / pharma class), and a literature note = already made / close analogue made / not found.
The numeric columns are read from top10_recommendations_all_drugs.csv and xtb_molecule_properties.csv (see theory_check_shortlist_raw.csv).
Literature notes and sources were gathered by hand (web search + fetch) and are stored here as text; they are evidence about the pairs, not model output.
Writes: new_pairs_theory_check.csv"""
